 past, Dragan, and a young worker and father of a family, Daniele, share a passion for the game of chess, thanks to which they get to know each other and become good friends. When Mr. Assante, a wealthy and ruthless entrepreneur, decides to move his company abroad where the profits are greater, Daniele, unemployed and desperate for his disastrous financial conditions, convinces the reluctant Dragan to dust off his criminal past."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yH5PU5xzDo02yDg9i6eVRrkNQLc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yH5PU5xzDo02yDg9i6eVRrkNQLc.jpg","language":"it","width":667,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/70CMtwduEEZoDSqhR6CSe5XXxsT.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/70CMtwduEEZoDSqhR6CSe5XXxsT.jpg","language":"xx","width":750,"height":1000}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/73PUCEeZkunrypoKi3Tbx6NdNbU.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/73PUCEeZkunrypoKi3Tbx6NdNbU.jpg","language":"xx","width":2702,"height":1520}]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yH5PU5xzDo02yDg9i6eVRrkNQLc.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/73PUCEeZkunrypoKi3Tbx6NdNbU.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1237640,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yH5PU5xzDo02yDg9i6eVRrkNQLc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yH5PU5xzDo02yDg9i6eVRrkNQLc.jpg","language":"it","width":667,"height":1000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yH5PU5xzDo02yDg9i6eVRrkNQLc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yH5PU5xzDo02yDg9i6eVRrkNQLc.jpg","language":"it","width":667,"height":1000}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"xx":{"status":"av